{"uuid":"3725379c-676d-4efd-81ee-7e45d80db6d0","variant":"base","mode":"judged","verdict":"pass","notes":"as=player, desktop 1440x900 and mobile 390x844: castable from hand; after the 3 draws a non-cancellable shuffleInto prompt (chooseCards, min=max=2) heads \"Shuffle 2 cards into your deck\" from the source, offers exactly the 5 hand cards on the hand surface, Submit inert until 2 are picked; reload mid-prompt restores the same prompt id; chosen cards enter the deck, nothing in the deck stays known, one shuffledIntoDeck event names them; log names both drawn cards and the shuffled ones; no clipping, __caps empty","screens":["fragments-hand-desktop.png","fragments-prompt-desktop.png","fragments-selected-desktop.png","fragments-settled-desktop.png","fragments-log-desktop.png","fragments-hand-mobile.png","fragments-prompt-mobile.png","fragments-selected-mobile.png","fragments-settled-mobile.png","fragments-log-mobile.png"],"bead":"hv-umm2.64","commit":"956235bc4afb6f5a39d2010f8493f83f68c5f693"}
{"uuid":"3725379c-676d-4efd-81ee-7e45d80db6d0","variant":"base","mode":"judged","verdict":"pass","notes":"as=enemy, desktop and mobile: the AI plays it and answers its own shuffle choice; the human log reads the draws and the shuffle as counts only (2 hidden hand cards shuffled into the opponent deck), no opponent hand card is shown face up; __caps empty","screens":["fragments-enemy-start-desktop.png","fragments-enemy-settled-desktop.png","fragments-enemy-log-desktop.png","fragments-enemy-start-mobile.png","fragments-enemy-settled-mobile.png","fragments-enemy-log-mobile.png"],"bead":"hv-umm2.64","commit":"956235bc4afb6f5a39d2010f8493f83f68c5f693"}
{"uuid":"28f8d95a-be99-4b4c-b9ef-92a4b40fffe7","variant":"base","mode":"judged","verdict":"pass","notes":"as=player, desktop and mobile: tapping the staged character activates it; a cancellable \"Choose up to 3 targets\" gallery offers exactly the 4 void cards with Skip and Cancel; Cancel leaves the character in play and the void unchanged; 3 picks then Submit pay the abandon (source to void), shuffle the 3 chosen cards into the deck (shuffledIntoDeck from void, named in the log to the player) and draw a card; the unchosen void card stays; no clipping, __caps empty","screens":["frost-targets-desktop.png","frost-selected-desktop.png","frost-settled-desktop.png","frost-log-desktop.png","frost-targets-mobile.png","frost-selected-mobile.png","frost-settled-mobile.png","frost-log-mobile.png"],"bead":"hv-umm2.64","commit":"956235bc4afb6f5a39d2010f8493f83f68c5f693"}
{"uuid":"28f8d95a-be99-4b4c-b9ef-92a4b40fffe7","variant":"base","mode":"judged","verdict":"pass","notes":"as=enemy, desktop and mobile: the AI plays the character (sweep base as enemy passed) but in a 150 s staged run (enemy back rank Frostbound Defiant, 3 void cards) Greedy never chose to activate it, so the opponent-side void shuffle was not observed in the browser; its presentation for both humans is covered by the prompt-lab shuffle-into fixture in the presentation completeness test, and its public naming by the shuffleInto contracts; __caps empty","screens":["frost-enemy-start-desktop.png","frost-enemy-start-mobile.png"],"bead":"hv-umm2.64","commit":"956235bc4afb6f5a39d2010f8493f83f68c5f693"}
